   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`h [T, 4096]  → next layer`"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-layerp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": 1724,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "Per layer: SWA attention **94.4M**, GA attention **89.1M** (fewer KV heads), router 1.0M, 256 experts × 25.2M = **6.44B** stored, 8 × 25.2M = 201.3M used per token. No shared expert (`n_shared_experts: null`)."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-l0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 50,
   "y": 1724,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "**L0** differs: global attention and a dense SwiGLU FFN 4096 → 16384 → 4096 (201.3M) instead of the MoE. The 3 MTP blocks use SWA attention with the same dense FFN shape."
  }
